# mcp-frisk has no settings, and by design it never will need an API key: it reads
# config files on your machine, makes no network call and starts no process.
#
# If a later version adds a setting (a path, say), its name goes here with where to
# get its value, never the value. Copy this file to .env at the repo root to set it;
# the real environment wins over the file.
